 "description": "Suspicious. Both defence lines are manned: the border (heavy forts west, light forts east) and the inner line Marenta - north of Nanta (21, 17, 13, 8, 97). On the first line next to Zille City stand 2 tanks (Pomara Northwest 36, Pomara West 117). Zille City (a city, so no unit on it) is ringed by infantry and mechanized (\"motorized\" = mechanized_infantry) units in its neighbour provinces 30, 31, 38, 116 plus the border units on 36, 117, 39. Around Wiktrany stands a reserve (tanks 112-25, mechanized 24-106, paratroopers 113). Port Rotsla island (96) has infantry. On the Derdian border a screen stands on the southern front (infantry 122, 88, militia 93, 95, mountain infantry 119 behind). The navy is bigger, the flagship is in Zille Bay (S52), and two blocking lines stop a Rizian advance past Nanta and Munat: S25-S22-S18-S21 right in front of the Rizian east seas, then S17-S20-S12-S11-S16-S7 around Munat; the west coast is screened by S55-S54-S51.",
